<div class="ic-scroll-factory-shell">
  <header class="ic-scroll-factory-header">
    <div class="ic-scroll-factory-brand">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-scroll"></i>
      <div>
        <span class="ic-kicker">Native D&D5e Utility</span>
        <h1>Scroll Factory</h1>
        <p>v{{version}} · {{stage}}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>Create official D&D5e Spell Scrolls directly in the World Items Directory. The system's native Scroll generator remains responsible for the resulting Item.</p>
  </header>

  <main class="ic-scroll-factory-main">
    <section class="ic-scroll-drop-zone {{#if busy}}busy{{/if}}" data-scroll-drop-zone>
      {{#if busy}}
      <i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i>
      <h2>Creating Scroll…</h2>
      <p>Complete the native D&D5e Scroll dialog.</p>
      {{else}}
      <i class="fa-solid fa-file-arrow-down"></i>
      <h2>Drop a Spell Here</h2>
      <p>Drag a Spell from a compendium, the Compendium Browser, World Items, or an Actor.</p>
      <span>One confirmed drop creates one Spell Scroll.</span>
      {{/if}}
    </section>

    <div class="ic-scroll-or"><span>or</span></div>

    <button type="button" class="ic-scroll-browse-button" data-action="browse-scroll-spells" {{#if busy}}disabled{{/if}}>
      <i class="fa-solid fa-books"></i>
      <span>
        <strong>Browse Spells</strong>
        <small>Open the native D&D5e Compendium Browser restricted to Spell Items.</small>
      </span>
      <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i>
    </button>

    <aside class="ic-scroll-native-note">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
      <div>
        <strong>Native Scroll creation</strong>
        <p>The native dialog controls description detail, Save DC, and Spell Attack Bonus. The Spell is fixed to its base level, and the completed Scroll is saved as a World Item rather than placed in an Actor inventory.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

    {{#if lastCreated}}
    <section class="ic-scroll-created-card">
      <img src="{{lastCreated.img}}" alt="">
      <div>
        <span>Last Created</span>
        <strong>{{lastCreated.name}}</strong>
        <small>World Items Directory</small>
      </div>
      <button type="button" data-action="open-created-scroll">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square"></i>
        Open Item
      </button>
    </section>
    {{/if}}
  </main>

  <footer class="ic-scroll-factory-footer">
    <i class="fa-solid {{#if busy}}fa-spinner fa-spin{{else}}fa-circle-check{{/if}}"></i>
    <span>{{status}}</span>
  </footer>
</div>
